WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:13.600
A .NET 11 ASP.NET Core service uses
Microsoft.Extensions.DocumentExtraction:
PdfPig reads the text layer, while a
VisionLanguageModel client reads rendered
pages for tables, charts, and diagrams.

2
00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:29.900
Those outputs bridge into
Microsoft.Extensions.DataIngestion.
Heading-aware chunking preserves
structure, and Microsoft.ML.Tokenizers
enforces real token limits for predictable
model-sized chunks before embeddings are
generated.

3
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:44.100
Extraction, normalization, chunking,
embedding, and retrieval stay separate and
reviewable. Provenance supports
diagnostics for later inspection and
troubleshooting, while search results open
the Jellyfin item—not an answer citation.
